cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the article below."
title: "spinerebel: Zero-Cycle per-cycle spinal motion analysis"
abstract: >-
  Recording format specification, reference reader, and analysis code
  accompanying the Zero-Cycle continuous at-home spinal motion monitoring
  study: a per-cycle machine-learning substrate derived from a dual
  magnetometer-free IMU garment.
type: software
