      4th Military Hospital, Wrocław, Poland
  - family-names: Palczewska
    given-names: Anna
    affiliation: "Vratislavia Medica, Wrocław, Poland"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gmiekisiak/spinerebel"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - continuous monitoring
  - home monitoring
  - machine-learning substrate
  - per-cycle features
  - spine
  - inertial measurement unit
  - magnetometer-free
  - drift correction
  - cone of economy
